{"id":"aaa4ce04d94b448c8cf4f0bdd1b4927c79a3ab79","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246097","title":"什么样的 Google 账号才能订阅 Gemini？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"xxzhaoming","excerpt":"Google Gemini - @xxzhaoming - 想订阅 Gemini ，但一直提示'当前地区不支持'。我已经把账号的国家/地区改成美国了，还是不行。请问需要满足什么条件的 Google 账号才能正常订阅？打算在闲鱼上买那种便宜的订阅，想先确","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/Gemini\"><li></li> Gemini</a><a href=\"/tag/账号\"><li></li> 账号</a><a href=\"/tag/订阅\"><li></li> 订阅</a></P><p><span>20 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-03 00:17:29 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18144938\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/06bc/eb98/679304_normal.png?m=1782664383\" alt=\"osilinka\" data-uid=\"679304\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/osilinka\">osilinka</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 11:02:44 +08:00\">21h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>估计也需要把支付信息也修改了才能成功</p><p>目前印度应该可以的</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18144953\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3c712722e916f5291cfc7ce12adda91a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Dk2014\" data-uid=\"61509\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Dk2014\">Dk2014</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 11:06:36 +08:00\">21h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就 5 块钱，你买了之后直接激活就行了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18144986\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e38/0cf2/413420_normal.png?m=1789083210\" alt=\"413420\" data-uid=\"413420\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/413420\">413420</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 11:32:41 +08:00\">20h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>折腾 gemini 不如折腾 chatgpt 或 claude</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145022\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3acd/5809/429891_normal.png?m=1716195208\" alt=\"idragonet\" data-uid=\"429891\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/idragonet\">idragonet</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 11:52:16 +08:00\">20h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>1 、账号地区不能是中国和香港  2 、绑定过信用卡和结算账户全部删除掉 3 、IP 干净；   自己 4 个账号成功开 Pro</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145139\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3b198446b72d1e5a3b0090f106a75f3c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"sampeng\" data-uid=\"19005\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sampeng\">sampeng</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 13:05:44 +08:00\">19h 5m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/xxzhaoming\">xxzhaoming</a> 信新闻不如信我是秦始皇，喔 20 块钱买一个备着，纯粹是防止 c➗和 a➗两个畜生给我封号了我临时有得用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145281\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8363b61446a51cae58688ededf68ab83?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"iwenbin\" data-uid=\"159498\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iwenbin\">iwenbin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 14:32:47 +08:00\">17h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我是加入的别人的 Google one 家庭组自动开通的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145309\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/892a/8797/52157_normal.png?m=1742788600\" alt=\"crysislinux\" data-uid=\"52157\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/crysislinux\">crysislinux</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 14:49:45 +08:00\">17h 21m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你改的是哪里的账号国家，你自己改设置的那个地区其实不是账号地区。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145389\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/892a/8797/52157_normal.png?m=1742788600\" alt=\"crysislinux\" data-uid=\"52157\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/crysislinux\">crysislinux</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 16:07:09 +08:00\">16h 3m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/xxzhaoming\">xxzhaoming</a> 自己改的没用，要 Google 认定你是哪里的才行。你搜一下，这个问题有专门的教程，要给 Google 提交一个改区域的请求。但是不知道你新号行不行。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145408\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/950278cf5f637f3f0ddc116601e93969?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nsjs\" data-uid=\"507787\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nsjs\">nsjs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 16:19:48 +08:00\">15h 51m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你要不先清空浏览器，登陆 Gemini 网页端看看能不能用啊。 可能是单纯的梯子送中了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145511\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b358/ea00/366401_normal.png?m=1698218600\" alt=\"Mandy0\" data-uid=\"366401\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Mandy0\">Mandy0</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 17:53:30 +08:00\">14h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>梯子的问题，我是 Google One 会员，梯子不对经常被提示到不支持</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145838\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a555/fb36/45152_normal.png?m=1669299199\" alt=\"airdrop\" data-uid=\"45152\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/airdrop\">airdrop</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 22:57:43 +08:00\">9h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>让 claude 操作你的账号分析下，很快就找到问题了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145911\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6304/a0ce/532512_normal.png?m=1733319904\" alt=\"Lukedis\" data-uid=\"532512\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Lukedis\">Lukedis</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 00:17:29 +08:00\">7h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不知道，我的快十年 gmail 账户，淘宝 20 多开的 1 年 pro ，大概是谷歌手机或者学生优惠，我这个号嫖过 google 云 1 年 300 美金的活动</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"Gemini 账号 订阅20 replies • 2026-10-03 00:17:29 +08:00 1 osilinka 21h 8m ago 估计也需要把支付信息也修改了才能成功目前印度应该可以的 2 Dk2014 21h 4m ago 就 5 块钱，你买了之后直接激活就行了 4 413420 20h 38m ago 折腾 gemini 不如折腾 chatgpt 或 claude 6 idragonet 20h 18m ago 1 、账号地区不能是中国和香港 2 、绑定过信用卡和结算账户全部删除掉 3 、IP 干净； 自己 4 个账号成功开 Pro 8 sampeng 19h 5m ago via iPhone @xxzhaoming 信新闻不如信我是秦始皇，喔 20 块钱买一个备着，纯粹是防止 c➗和 a➗两个畜生给我封号了我临时有得用 10 iwenbin 17h 38m ago 我是加入的别人的 Google one 家庭组自动开通的 11 crysislinux 17h 21m ago via Android 你改的是哪里的账号国家，你自己改设置的那个地区其实不是账号地区。 13 crysislinux 16h 3m ago via Android @xxzhaoming 自己改的没用，要 Google 认定你是哪里的才行。你搜一下，这个问题有专门的教程，要给 Google 提交一个改区域的请求。但是不知道你新号行不行。 14 nsjs 15h 51m ago via iPhone 你要不先清空浏览器，登陆 